1
00:00:01,040 --> 00:00:03,280
Hi everyone. In this video, I'm going to

2
00:00:03,280 --> 00:00:05,440
show you how to delete and archive tasks

3
00:00:05,440 --> 00:00:07,759
and lists in Blitzet. Two handy ways to

4
00:00:07,759 --> 00:00:10,400
keep your workspace tidy and organized.

5
00:00:10,400 --> 00:00:12,639
To delete a task, simply hover over the

6
00:00:12,639 --> 00:00:14,559
task you want to remove, open the

7
00:00:14,559 --> 00:00:17,840
expanded menu, and click delete. Keep in

8
00:00:17,840 --> 00:00:19,840
mind that this is permanent. Deleted

9
00:00:19,840 --> 00:00:22,000
tasks cannot be recovered and won't show

10
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:23,840
up in your reports where you track your

11
00:00:23,840 --> 00:00:26,880
progress. When it comes to lists, the

12
00:00:26,880 --> 00:00:29,119
process is a bit different. Instead of

13
00:00:29,119 --> 00:00:31,359
deleting right away, you first archive

14
00:00:31,359 --> 00:00:34,079
it. Click the three dot menu next to the

15
00:00:34,079 --> 00:00:36,800
list name and select archive list.

16
00:00:36,800 --> 00:00:38,559
Archiving and moves the list out of your

17
00:00:38,559 --> 00:00:40,800
active workspace, but keeps it safe for

18
00:00:40,800 --> 00:00:43,280
later. Your archived lists will appear

19
00:00:43,280 --> 00:00:45,200
in the archived list section on the left

20
00:00:45,200 --> 00:00:47,200
side of your home screen. From there,

21
00:00:47,200 --> 00:00:49,200
you can choose to unarchive the list to

22
00:00:49,200 --> 00:00:51,440
make it active again, or click delete

23
00:00:51,440 --> 00:00:53,360
forever to remove the list and all of

24
00:00:53,360 --> 00:00:55,840
its tasks. Just be sure you really don't

25
00:00:55,840 --> 00:00:57,920
need it anymore as this action cannot be

26
00:00:57,920 --> 00:00:59,440
undone.

27
00:00:59,440 --> 00:01:01,520
You can also go to the archived done

28
00:01:01,520 --> 00:01:04,159
tasks section here. It is a list of the

29
00:01:04,159 --> 00:01:06,400
tasks which are done and are older than

30
00:01:06,400 --> 00:01:08,560
60 days. So they get automatically

31
00:01:08,560 --> 00:01:10,159
archived.

32
00:01:10,159 --> 00:01:11,680
So that's your quick guide to deleting

33
00:01:11,680 --> 00:01:13,920
and archiving tasks and list in Blitzet.

34
00:01:13,920 --> 00:01:15,920
For more tips and support, don't forget

35
00:01:15,920 --> 00:01:18,000
to explore our other tutorials and join

36
00:01:18,000 --> 00:01:20,080
our Discord community. We'd love to see

37
00:01:20,080 --> 00:01:24,360
you there. Happy Blitzing.